<title>FRANCE: Libya may import optional-origin barley -traders.</title>
<headline>Libya may import optional-origin barley -traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Libya is in the market to import optional origin barley, European grain traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Over the past two weeks Libya has been asking exporters for barley prices but without providing details over tonnages or shipment dates sought, they said.</p>
<p>The latest forecasts from the International Grains Council put Libyan barley imports at 300,000 tonnes for 1996/97, unchanged from the previous season.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
